Package: dev.iosvuln.collect
Name: iosvuln Collector
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: iosvuln
Description: On-device kernelcache / kext collector for iosvuln static analysis. Collects from system paths or a user-specified path; no exploit, no PoC, no behaviour modification.
Section: Tweaks
Depends: bash, coreutils, grep
